    "rawHtml": "<div>\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-6 lg:px-8 relative\">\n    <div class=\"relative flex h-16 space-x-10 w-full\">\n      <div class=\"flex justify-start\"><a class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center\" href=\"/\">\n          <img class=\"block h-8 w-auto\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://www.svgrepo.com/show/303650/neo-logo.svg\" >\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex px-2 py-3 items-center space-x-8 flex-1 justify-end justify-self-end \"><a\n          class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-lime-700 text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/login\">Login</a>\n        <a class=\"text-white bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-900 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-3 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm \"\n          href=\"/signup\">Sign up</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto relative\">\n    <div class=\"relative py-16 flex justify-center px-4 sm:px-0\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-3xl text-center\">\n        <div class=\"pb-4\">\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-2xl bg-lime-100 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-serif font-medium text-lime-700\">Unlock the potential of AI in education.</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-gray-900 xl:text-6xl font-serif !leading-tight\">\n          Discover the future of teaching\n        </h1>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-8 text-gray-800 sm:px-16\" style=\"white-space: pre-line;\">Empower your classroom with cutting-edge AI technology. Whether it's lesson planning or creating interactive learning materials, our AI service has got you covered.</p>\n        <div class=\"mt-8 flex w-full space-x-8 justify-center\"><a\n            href=\"/exercises\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-transparent ring-offset-transparent disabled:bg-gray-400 appearance-none text-white bg-lime-600 hover:bg-lime-700 focus:ring-lime-500 focus:ring-offset-white !px-12 !shadow-lg !rounded-full !text-base\"><p>Start now for free</p></button></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
